# WarriorUseSkill (20136) is hit twice by the character standing 100 away. WarriorBehavior
# wants to attack the character at 10 per point of damage. Its first skill (SKILL01_ID) aims
# by default at its top desire target as the hit begins, at any distance, on a draw under
# 3333: the first hit finds none, the second the character, wanted at 1000000000, which its
# AI's next ticks cast. Its other targets, its clan, party, sight and spell hooks need what
# the format still lacks, AI parameters and privates (#4052): tests/ai/warrior_use_skill_test.go
# covers them.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterBehavior.MonsterBehavior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterBehavior.WarriorBehavior.WarriorBehavior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterBehavior.WarriorBehavior.WarriorUseSkill.WarriorUseSkill
npc warrior 20136 Monster 100 0 0 walks skill SKILL01_ID 4157 4

hit warrior 22
  desires warrior attack(player)=220
hit warrior 22
  desires warrior attack(player)=440 cast(player,4157,move)=1000000000
tick x2
  S MagicSkillUse caster=warrior target=player skill=4157-4 hit=10571 reuse=0 success=0
